{"id": "EXP-001", "status": "active", "situation": "競爭者網站的 sitemap 有一個佔比很大的單一資料夾，網址是關鍵字當 slug（例如博弈、貸款這類高競爭詞）。要判斷它如何針對指定關鍵字做頁面，並確認 sitemap 的占比能不能代表全站。網域可能曾換過主人或換過主題。", "route": "1. sitemap_tree：用 search 搜指定關鍵字，再用 sample 看最大分區的網址型態，因為 slug 就是對方的關鍵字佈局。\n2. polite_fetch：抓指定關鍵字的專頁和該分區列表頁，因為要看 title、H1、H2、FAQ 與分類結構才能判斷模板化程度。\n3. sitemap_tree：對首頁最新文章網址再搜一次並用 by_month 看 lastmod 截止月份，因為 sitemap 可能漏掉新文，占比不能當全站比例。\n4. wayback：用 timeline 看歷史存檔，再用 snapshot 抓換手前最後的首頁快照，因為註冊日比存檔晚時要確認網域是否換過主題。", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0094", "E-0117", "E-0118", "E-0123", "E-0139", "E-0140", "E-0120", "E-0125"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0117"], "call_n": 5}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0118"], "call_n": 6}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0120"], "call_n": 7}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0118"], "call_n": 8}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0123"], "call_n": 9}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0125"], "call_n": 11}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0123"], "call_n": 12}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20251108182921id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0125"], "call_n": 13}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0139"], "call_n": 20}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0140"], "call_n": 21}], "route_summary": [{"n": 5, "tool": "sitemap_tree", "target": null, "why": "看最大分區的網址型態", "evidence_ids": ["E-0117"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 6, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/"}, "why": "讀選單「線上娛樂城推薦」指向的分區首頁", "evidence_ids": ["E-0118"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 7, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/"}, "why": "確認網域註冊於 2026-04 但 Wayback 有 2020 起存檔，檢查舊站內容", "evidence_ids": ["E-0120", "E-0121"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 8, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/"}, "why": "看 /wordcup/ 頁面結構、連結、外部連結", "evidence_ids": ["E-0118", "E-0122"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 9, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "指定關鍵字 3A娛樂城 對應頁", "evidence_ids": ["E-0123"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 11, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/"}, "why": "看 2025 年網域舊內容，判斷是否為舊站被接手", "evidence_ids": ["E-0125", "E-0126"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 12, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "看 3A娛樂城頁的標題結構、外部連結、JSON-LD、內文", "evidence_ids": ["E-0123", "E-0127"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 13, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20251108182921id_/https://2030.tw/"}, "why": "看 2025 年舊站是什麼內容", "evidence_ids": ["E-0125", "E-0128"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 20, "tool": "sitemap_tree", "target": null, "why": "確認 10 月底的文章是否在 sitemap（驗證 sitemap 是否漏掉 8 月後文章）", "evidence_ids": ["E-0139"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 21, "tool": "sitemap_tree", "target": null, "why": "看 /taiwanplus/ 每月 lastmod，驗證 sitemap 截止時間", "evidence_ids": ["E-0140"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}], "source_run": "seq-r1-20261117-225453", "proposal_id": "P1", "added_at": "2026-11-17T23:02:31+0800"}
